sequenceDiagram
    participant G as Glasses
    participant P as Phone
    participant L as Laptop
    participant C as Cloud
    G->>P: Prompt or cue
    P->>C: Store context and task state
    P->>L: Escalate for deeper work
    L->>C: Publish result
    C->>P: Sync response
    P->>G: Deliver concise follow-up
